---
layout: base.njk
langue: en
title: Menu, French bistro in Paris 16th
permalink: /en/menu/
alternate: /menu/
description: "The menu at Les Coltineurs, French bistro in Paris 16th near the Eiffel Tower: seasonal starters, fish, meat, cheese and desserts, veal sweetbreads, blue lobster."
ogImage: plat-ris-de-veau-morilles.jpg
jsonld: menu
---
<header class="titre-page conteneur">
  <p class="surtitre">À la carte</p>
  <h1>The menu</h1>
  <p class="chapo">The menu changes with the seasons and the market. Dish names are in French: ask us anything about a dish or an allergen, we will gladly explain in English.</p>
</header>

<div class="conteneur etroit">
  <ul class="sommaire" aria-label="Menu sections">
    {%- for c in menu.categories %}<li><a href="#{{ c.id }}">{{ c.nom | trad }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="carte">
    {%- for c in menu.categories %}
    <section class="carte__categorie" id="{{ c.id }}" aria-labelledby="t-{{ c.id }}">
      <h2 id="t-{{ c.id }}">{{ c.nom | trad }}</h2>
      {%- for s in c.sousCategories %}
      <div class="carte__groupe">
        {% if s.nom %}<h3>{{ s.nom | trad }}</h3>{% endif %}
        <ul class="plats">
          {%- for p in s.plats %}
          <li class="plat">
            <span class="plat__nom" lang="fr">{{ p.nom }}</span>
            <span class="plat__prix">{{ p.prix }}</span>
            {% if p.detail %}<p class="plat__detail" lang="fr">{{ p.detail }}</p>{% endif %}
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="carte__note">Prices in euros, service included. Allergen information is available on request.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="boutons" style="justify-content:center; margin: 2.5rem 0 4rem;">
    <a class="bouton bouton--plein" href="{{ site.zenchef.reserver }}" rel="noopener">Book a table</a>
    <a class="bouton" href="/en/wine-list/">The wine list</a>
  </div>
</div>
